    LLM: "Remember the special trump ranking (Under and 9 are highest). Try to capture the Puur and Nell. Support your partner's efforts.\n\nBid based on hand strength and distribution. Void yourself in weak suits. Save trumps for when you need them.\n\nCard counting is essential. Track trumps and high cards. Coordinate with partner through card play signals. Understand when to sacrifice tricks.",
